/* 江南禧主风格：白色内容区、暖灰底、深灰文字、杏橙交互与少量珊瑚红强调。 */
page,
.theme-root,
.theme-jiangnanxi {
  --font-body: "PingFang SC", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-number: "DIN Alternate", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-display: "STSong", "Songti SC", serif;
  --color-bg-page: #f5f4f3;
  --color-bg-surface: #ffffff;
  --color-bg-section: #ffffff;
  --color-bg-warm: #fbf8f5;
  --color-bg-muted: #f1f0ef;
  --color-bg-media: #f4f1ed;
  --color-bg-primary-soft: #fff1e7;
  --color-text-heading: #272321;
  --color-text-primary: #332e2b;
  --color-text-secondary: #6f6864;
  --color-text-muted: #9d9692;
  --color-text-faint: #b8b2ae;
  --color-primary: #e18a4b;
  --color-primary-light: #f0a56b;
  --color-primary-muted: #f2b47a;
  --color-primary-pressed: #c97339;
  --color-accent-jade: #d6a861;
  --color-accent-blush: #f17c87;
  --color-accent-blush-strong: #eb5268;
  --color-accent-red: #ff3152;
  --color-accent-orange: #f2a05f;
  --color-accent-yellow: #f4cb4f;
  --color-white: #ffffff;
  --color-divider: #ece8e5;
  --color-border-hairline: rgba(72, 56, 48, 0.08);
  --color-border-soft: rgba(72, 56, 48, 0.045);
  --color-border: rgba(72, 56, 48, 0.09);
  --color-border-strong: rgba(72, 56, 48, 0.17);
  --color-shadow-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025);
  --color-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  --color-shadow-primary: rgba(194, 103, 42, 0.2);
  --color-modal-backdrop: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  --color-modal-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
  --color-surface-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
  --color-surface-glass-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  --color-nav-surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  --color-nav-indicator: #ff3152;
  --color-nav-ring: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
  --color-nav-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  --color-nav-shadow-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
}

.theme-healing-ins {
  /* 治愈 INS 备用风格。 */
  --color-bg-page: #f6f4ef;
  --color-bg-surface: #fcfbf7;
  --color-bg-section: #f8f7f3;
  --color-bg-warm: #faf9f5;
  --color-bg-muted: #f0f1ec;
  --color-bg-media: #e9ece7;
  --color-bg-primary-soft: #e7eeea;
  --color-text-heading: #3f4c49;
  --color-text-primary: #414b48;
  --color-text-secondary: #7b8682;
  --color-text-muted: #87918d;
  --color-text-faint: #989e9b;
  --color-primary: #607d76;
  --color-primary-light: #6f8f88;
  --color-primary-muted: #7d9a93;
  --color-primary-pressed: #536f68;
  --color-accent-jade: #a7c8c0;
  --color-accent-blush: #b77c72;
  --color-accent-blush-strong: #a66f67;
  --color-white: #ffffff;
  --color-divider: rgba(83, 101, 95, 0.08);
  --color-border-hairline: rgba(83, 101, 95, 0.09);
  --color-border-soft: rgba(96, 125, 118, 0.08);
  --color-border: rgba(96, 125, 118, 0.12);
  --color-border-strong: rgba(96, 125, 118, 0.18);
  --color-shadow-soft: rgba(71, 84, 80, 0.07);
  --color-shadow: rgba(71, 84, 80, 0.1);
  --color-shadow-primary: rgba(79, 105, 98, 0.14);
  --color-modal-backdrop: rgba(37, 43, 41, 0.48);
  --color-modal-shadow: rgba(45, 55, 51, 0.18);
  --color-surface-glass: rgba(252, 251, 247, 0.82);
  --color-surface-glass-strong: rgba(252, 251, 247, 0.96);
  --color-nav-surface: rgba(251, 250, 247, 0.97);
  --color-nav-indicator: #86a49c;
  --color-nav-ring: rgba(248, 247, 243, 0.98);
  --color-nav-shadow: rgba(71, 84, 80, 0.11);
  --color-nav-shadow-soft: rgba(71, 84, 80, 0.04);
}

/* DIY 正在等待重构，维持本轮调整前的视觉变量，避免被其他页面的主题优化带动。 */
.theme-jiangnanxi .diy-page {
  --color-bg-page: #f6f6f6;
  --color-bg-surface: #ffffff;
  --color-bg-section: #ffffff;
  --color-bg-warm: #fafafa;
  --color-bg-muted: #f5f5f5;
  --color-bg-media: #fafafa;
  --color-bg-primary-soft: #f5f5f5;
  --color-text-heading: #333333;
  --color-text-primary: #333333;
  --color-text-secondary: #666666;
  --color-text-muted: #999999;
  --color-text-faint: #999999;
  --color-primary: #2f2f2f;
  --color-primary-light: #666666;
  --color-primary-muted: #ad9568;
  --color-primary-pressed: #171717;
  --color-accent-jade: #ad9568;
  --color-accent-blush: #c27a6a;
  --color-accent-blush-strong: #9c5f54;
  --color-divider: #eeeeee;
  --color-border-hairline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  --color-border-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  --color-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  --color-border-strong: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
  --color-shadow-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025);
  --color-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  --color-shadow-primary: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

/* 页面里原先固定的 INS 配色，按主题覆盖。 */
.theme-jiangnanxi .home-hub {
  background: var(--color-bg-surface);
}

.theme-jiangnanxi .hero,
.theme-jiangnanxi .home-hub-identity__avatar-shell {
  background: var(--color-bg-media);
}

.theme-jiangnanxi .hero__fallback {
  background: var(--color-bg-muted);
}

.theme-jiangnanxi .hero__retry {
  background: var(--color-primary);
}

.theme-jiangnanxi .tab-bar__item--active .tab-bar__icon {
  filter: none;
}

.theme-jiangnanxi .tab-bar__item--primary .tab-bar__icon {
  filter: none;
}
